{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yinglet Creator</strong> lets you create yinglets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a small, free, fan-made character creator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's a &quot;Yinglet&quot;?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They're a fictional species from the long-running webcomic: Out-of-Placers by Val Salia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954540/extras/b70cd3c031d04b24bcb17d78fc935b20.avif?t=1759727861\" alt=\"\"data-has-big width=1560 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What can I customize?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eyes, hair, fur patterns, clothes, and much more with over 200 toggles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully recolor anything</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust proportions with a bunch of sliders</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954540/extras/ef2ec070b501bce7e2a7b2ba0dfd2ae8.avif?t=1759727861\" width=1560 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What can I do with my yinglets?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save them, share them with friends, and take pictures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dedicated photo mode lets you pose your creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954540/extras/2bcd2ca5cd2d58b279a5eb2daa56352b.avif?t=1759727861\" width=1560 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Is there any gameplay?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nope! Just the character creator.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954540?t=1759727861","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954540/5134726b0b5c1ae18418a432817292138a7a4b20/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759727861","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954540/efb4794ce0876321e904c64652a9ee2ba1b5010b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759727861","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954540/efb4794ce0876321e904c64652a9ee2ba1b5010b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759727861","categories":[{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yinglet Creator</strong> lets you create yinglets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a small, free, fan-made character creator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's a &quot;Yinglet&quot;?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They're a fictional species from the long-running webcomic: Out-of-Placers by Val Salia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954540/extras/b70cd3c031d04b24bcb17d78fc935b20.avif?t=1759727861\" alt=\"\"data-has-big width=1560 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What can I customize?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eyes, hair, fur patterns, clothes, and much more with over 200 toggles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully recolor anything</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust proportions with a bunch of sliders</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954540/extras/ef2ec070b501bce7e2a7b2ba0dfd2ae8.avif?t=1759727861\" width=1560 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What can I do with my yinglets?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save them, share them with friends, and take pictures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dedicated photo mode lets you pose your creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954540/extras/2bcd2ca5cd2d58b279a5eb2daa56352b.avif?t=1759727861\" width=1560 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Is there any gameplay?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nope! Just the character creator.</p>","developers":["Tabski"],"genres":[{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954540/5ba5039893a19aa373e3d6e04292bf04ed4dfee5/header.jpg?t=1759727861","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3954540/579259547/4c5c86e9c5a6fd7aa0fbbc5264570b91cdd34562/1759727403/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759727859","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3954540/579259547/4c5c86e9c5a6fd7aa0fbbc5264570b91cdd34562/1759727403/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759727859","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3954540/579259547/4c5c86e9c5a6fd7aa0fbbc5264570b91cdd34562/1759727403/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759727859","id":257212815,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257212815/movie480.mp4?t=1759727859","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257212815/movie_max.mp4?t=1759727859"},"name":"Yinglet Creator - Trailer","thumbnail":"https://